{"pin":"AB06528","subcodes":[{"code":"AB06528","anchor":"","first_line":"O seeker of Truth! If thou desirest that God may open thy (spiritual) eye, thou must supplicate unto God, pray to and commune with Him at midnight… O Lord, I have turned my face unto Thy kingdom of oneness","word_count":"130","full_text_parts":["O seeker of Truth! If thou desirest that God may open thine eye, thou must supplicate unto God, pray to and commune with Him at midnight, saying: O Lord, I have turned my face unto Thy kingdom of oneness and am immersed in the sea of Thy mercy. O Lord, enlighten my sight by beholding Thy lights in this dark night, and make me happy by the wine of Thy love in this wonderful age. O Lord, make me hear Thy call, and open before my face the doors of Thy heaven, so that I may see the light of Thy glory and become attracted to Thy beauty. Verily, Thou art the Giver, the Generous, the Merciful, the Forgiving."],"translations":[],"refs":[{"kind":"music","code":"A. Wensbo","source":"A","locator":"Wensbo","url":"https://wensbomusic.com/track/midnight-prayer"},{"kind":"music","code":"D. Stevenson","source":"D","locator":"Stevenson","url":"https://dannystevensonmusic.com/track/midnight"},{"kind":"music","code":"G. Sterling","source":"G","locator":"Sterling","url":"https://youtu.be/2H3Ui6L1BDM"},{"kind":"music","code":"M. Sparrow","source":"M","locator":"Sparrow","url":"https://munirihsparrow.bandcamp.com/track/midnight-prayer"},{"kind":"music","code":"The Bird \u0026 The Butterfly","source":"The Bird \u0026 The Butterfly","url":"https://thebirdandthebutterfly.bandcamp.com/track/midnight-prayer"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BPRY.061x","source":"BPRY","locator":"061x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/854275091"},{"kind":"translation","code":"TAB.676-677","source":"TAB","locator":"676-677","url":"https://books.google.com/books?id=5R0qAQAAMAAJ\u0026pg=PA676"}]},{"code":"AB06528MID","anchor":"mid","translations":[{"language":"pt","lang_name":"Portuguese"},{"language":"be"